"vragen, stuur je een e-mail naar ondersteuning met je bestellings-ID."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1445
msgid "Shown at checkout and on receipt PDFs. Plain English; no HTML required."
msgstr ""
"Weergegeven bij de kassa en op ontvangstbewijs-PDF's. Gewone tekst; geen "
"HTML vereist."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1465
msgid "PLUGIN NOT ACTIVE"
msgstr "PLUGIN NIET ACTIEF"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1469
msgid ""
"Route Learnomy purchases through WooCommerce checkout. Optional: installing "
"WooCommerce does not change anything on its own. When off, Learnomy uses "
"its own Stripe and PayPal checkout."
msgstr ""
"Learnomy-aankopen routeren via WooCommerce-kassa. Optioneel: het "
"installeren van WooCommerce verandert op zichzelf niets. Wanneer uit, "
"gebruikt Learnomy zijn eigen Stripe- en PayPal-kassa."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1475
msgid "Use WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce gebruiken"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1484
msgid "Send Learnomy purchases to the WooCommerce cart and checkout"
msgstr "Learnomy-aankopen naar de WooCommerce-winkelwagen en kassa sturen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1492
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses and memberships check out through WooCommerce "
"(one dynamic line item per purchase). Requires WooCommerce to stay active. "
"Leave off to keep Learnomy's built-in Stripe/PayPal checkout."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingeschakeld, checken betaalde cursussen en lidmaatschappen uit via "
"WooCommerce (één dynamisch regelitem per aankoop). Vereist dat WooCommerce "
"actief blijft. Laat uit om de ingebouwde Stripe/PayPal-kassa van Learnomy "
"te behouden."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1494
msgid ""
"Activate the WooCommerce plugin to use this option. Learnomy keeps using "
"its own Stripe/PayPal checkout until then."
msgstr ""
"Activeer de WooCommerce-plugin om deze optie te gebruiken. Learnomy blijft "
"zijn eigen Stripe/PayPal-kassa gebruiken tot je het hebt geactiveerd."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1514
msgid "Test Gateway"
msgstr "Testgateway"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1515
msgid "DEVELOPMENT ONLY"
msgstr "ALLEEN VOOR ONTWIKKELING"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1518
msgid ""
"Synchronous in-memory gateway that completes every checkout without hitting "
"an external service. Useful for development, demos, and QA. Turn this off "
"before going live."
msgstr ""
"Synchrone in-memory gateway die elke kassa voltooit zonder een externe "
"service te bereiken. Handig voor ontwikkeling, demo's en QA. Zet dit uit "
"voordat je live gaat."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1524
msgid "Enable Test Gateway"
msgstr "Testgateway inschakelen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1532
msgid "Show the Test Gateway option at checkout"
msgstr "De Testgateway-optie bij de kassa weergeven"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1538
msgid ""
"When enabled, paid courses show a \"Test Gateway\" option alongside Stripe "
"and PayPal. Clicking it instantly records a completed transaction and "
"enrolls the buyer."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingeschakeld, geven betaalde cursussen een \"Testgateway\"-optie "
"naast Stripe en PayPal weer. Er op klikken registreert onmiddellijk een "
"voltooide transactie en schrijft de koper in."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1555
msgid ""
"Add one flat tax rate to every paid checkout, for basic compliance. Need "
"per-region rates, exemptions, or reporting? Use the WooCommerce gateway, "
"which brings its own tax engine."
msgstr ""
"Voeg één vast belastingtarief toe aan elke betaalde kassa, voor "
"basiscompliance. Nodig per regio's, uitzonderingen of rapportage? Gebruik "
"de WooCommerce-gateway, die zijn eigen belastingmotor meebrengt."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1559
msgid "Applies to Stripe checkouts only."
msgstr "Geldt alleen voor Stripe-kassa's."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1560
msgid ""
"PayPal and other gateways do not add this tax, so a sale paid through "
"PayPal collects no tax. If you sell via PayPal, use the WooCommerce gateway "
"(it brings its own tax engine) or configure tax inside PayPal."
msgstr ""
"PayPal en andere betalingsgateways voegen deze belasting niet toe, dus een "
"verkoop betaald via PayPal int geen belasting in. Als je via PayPal "
"verkoopt, gebruik dan de WooCommerce-gateway (deze heeft zijn eigen "
"belastingsysteem) of stel belasting in PayPal in."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1565
msgid "Collect tax"
msgstr "Belasting innen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1573
msgid "Add a flat tax rate to paid Stripe checkouts"
msgstr "Voeg een vast belastingtarief toe aan betaalde Stripe-aankopen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1579
msgid ""
"When enabled, the tax shows on the order summary and on the secure card "
"form, and is charged on top of the price."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingeschakeld, verschijnt de belasting op het orderoverzicht en op "
"het beveiligde kaartformulier, en wordt deze bovenop de prijs in rekening "
"gebracht."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1584
msgid "Tax rate (%)"
msgstr "Belastingtarief (%)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1589
msgid "A single percentage applied to every paid purchase, e.g. 20 for 20%."
msgstr ""
"Een enkel percentage dat op elke betaalde aankoop wordt toegepast, "
"bijvoorbeeld 20 voor 20%."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1593
msgid "Tax label"
msgstr "Belastinglabel"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1598
msgid "What to call the tax on the order summary, e.g. Tax, VAT, GST."
msgstr ""
"Hoe je de belasting op het orderoverzicht wilt noemen, bijv. Belasting, "
"BTW, GST."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1617
msgid "Membership page content"
msgstr "Inhoud lidmaatschapspagina"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1618
msgid "The headline, intro, and FAQ shown on the public membership pricing page."
msgstr ""
"De kop, intro en veelgestelde vragen op de openbare pagina met "
"lidmaatschapsprijzen."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1624
#: includes/services/view-data/class-membership-pricing-view-data.php:112
#: templates/membership-pricing.php:66
msgid "Simple, transparent pricing"
msgstr "Simpele, transparante prijzen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1625
msgid "Leave blank to use the default."
msgstr "Laat leeg om de standaard te gebruiken."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1629
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "Ondertitel"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1631
#: includes/services/view-data/class-membership-pricing-view-data.php:113
#: templates/membership-pricing.php:69
msgid "One subscription. Every course. Cancel anytime."
msgstr "Eén abonnement. Elke cursus. Annuleer wanneer je wilt."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1639
msgid "Page sections"
msgstr "Pagina sectie(s)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1640
